# Kanjak Puja Platform - Environment Variables
# The platform works 100% out-of-the-box locally with zero configuration.
# For production cloud persistence (e.g. Supabase / Neon / Vercel Postgres), configure below:

# Optional: Next.js Port (Default: 3000)
PORT=3000

# Optional: Production PostgreSQL / Supabase connection (if using cloud DB)
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@db.[YOUR-PROJECT-REF].supabase.co:5432/postgres"

# Optional: Vercel environment indicator
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://kanjak.vercel.app"
